<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:50,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

26
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to
run away from me?!</font>

27
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:25,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo... useless.</font>

28
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:31,000
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{The Yell That</font>

29
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:31,000
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{Can't Be Heard</font>

30
00:02:43,550 --> 00:02:45,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's you this time, huh?</font>

31
00:02:49,810 --> 00:02:56,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't do it.
I was not able to stop Sasuke-kun...</font>

32
00:02:57,400 --> 00:03:01,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think...
the one who can stop Sasuke-kun...</font>

33
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the one who can save Sasuke-kun is...</font>

34
00:03:05,030 --> 00:03:08,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... you are the only one.</font>

35
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... this is my...
once in a lifetime... favor to ask...</font>

36
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please... Please bring Sasuke-kun back!</font>

37
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:26,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I also told this to Sakura but...</font>

38
00:03:28,430 --> 00:03:30,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't mind me anymore.</font>

39
00:03:37,070 --> 00:03:39,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with that face?</font>

40
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:51,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei, why on the earth
does an outstanding person like me</font>

41
00:03:51,370 --> 00:03:53,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have to be on the same team with him?</font>

42
00:03:55,540 --> 00:03:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke graduated with
the highest grade out of all students...</font>

43
00:03:59,420 --> 00:04:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you are at the bottom!</font>

44
00:04:02,050 --> 00:04:04,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When you even out
the team's strength</font>

45
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:06,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then it naturally becomes like this.</font>

46
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:10,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try your best not to slow me down,
you dunce.</font>

47
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:16,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am fine without eating!
I am absolutely fine.</font>

48
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:20,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... fine...</font>

49
00:04:22,150 --> 00:04:23,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

50
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:38,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You asked Sakura for a hint the other day,
what did she tell you?</font>

51
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:42,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shall we go?</font>

52
00:04:43,470 --> 00:04:44,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yup.</font>

53
00:04:50,140 --> 00:04:53,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What's with that face...?</font>

54
00:04:55,980 --> 00:04:58,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot...</font>

55
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:01,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

56
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:08,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... I hated you..</font>

57
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:14,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's none of your business!</font>

58
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:25,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows,
my body moved on its own.</font>

59
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:33,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You rescue Sakura no matter what!</font>

60
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:37,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke... You...</font>

61
00:05:37,940 --> 00:05:42,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could still distract him for a little while...</font>

62
00:05:43,650 --> 00:05:46,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I lost everything once.</font>

63
00:05:47,150 --> 00:05:54,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to see my precious comrades
die in front of me anymore.</font>

64
00:05:57,870 --> 00:05:58,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

65
00:06:00,790 --> 00:06:04,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it... Sasuke?</font>

66
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you become like this?!</font>

67
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:15,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

68
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:24,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever happens to me,
what does that have to do with you?</font>

69
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:28,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have my own way.</font>

70
00:06:29,030 --> 00:06:30,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter who it is,</font>

71
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:32,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">nobody has the right
to tell me what to do.</font>

72
00:06:34,910 --> 00:06:36,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will tell you the truth.</font>

73
00:06:39,290 --> 00:06:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm done fooling around with
you guys of the Leaf.</font>

74
00:06:44,550 --> 00:06:45,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go home.</font>

75
00:06:59,190 --> 00:07:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of him!</font>

76
00:07:02,690 --> 00:07:03,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji...</font>

77
00:07:03,730 --> 00:07:05,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go everyone!</font>

78
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:11,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go quickly! I'll catch up with you.</font>

79
00:07:12,910 --> 00:07:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji...</font>

80
00:07:14,370 --> 00:07:15,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

81
00:07:17,950 --> 00:07:19,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold on!</font>

82
00:07:25,590 --> 00:07:26,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba...</font>

83
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:29,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba! Akamaru!</font>

84
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now! Naruto!</font>

85
00:07:34,850 --> 00:07:35,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru...</font>

86
00:07:36,930 --> 00:07:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The strategy... a success!</font>

87
00:07:38,980 --> 00:07:41,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?
Please go quickly!</font>

88
00:07:41,940 --> 00:07:46,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You also promised Sakura-san
with a Nice-Guy pose, Naruto-kun.</font>

89
00:07:47,610 --> 00:07:48,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow...</font>

90
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll defeat this person.</font>

91
00:07:54,070 --> 00:07:55,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a promise.</font>

92
00:07:57,540 --> 00:07:58,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone...</font>

93
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:06,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone risked their lives
to come after you, you know!</font>

94
00:08:08,630 --> 00:08:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good job for them.</font>

95
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lastly, I will tell you
the most important thing.</font>

96
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:34,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke is neither a close friend
of mine nor is he someone I like.</font>

97
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:38,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Sasuke is a Shinobi of
the Village Hidden in the Leaves...</font>

98
00:08:39,290 --> 00:08:40,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A comrade.</font>

99
00:08:40,950 --> 00:08:42,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why we will rescue him
by risking our lives.</font>

100
00:08:43,830 --> 00:08:45,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the Leaf way.</font>

101
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:09,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How do you take
your comrades of the Leaf?!</font>

102
00:09:39,850 --> 00:09:41,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Comrades, you said...</font>

103
00:09:43,770 --> 00:09:48,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I become stronger staying
with those so-called comrades?</font>

104
00:09:50,230 --> 00:09:52,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am going to where Orochimaru is.</font>

105
00:09:55,400 --> 00:09:58,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru is the person who killed
the Third Hokage</font>

106
00:09:58,410 --> 00:10:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and tried to crush The Leaf Village!</font>

107
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think he will
give you the power freely?</font>

108
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:10,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He just wants your body
as a vessel!</font>

109
00:10:11,250 --> 00:10:15,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You might not be able to come back.
You might get killed.</font>

110
00:10:15,340 --> 00:10:19,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think I'd easily let you
go to such a place?!</font>

111
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:37,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That doesn't matter to me...</font>

112
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:43,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If my goal is accomplished
then that's all that matters.</font>

113
00:10:45,290 --> 00:10:47,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you intend to get in that way...</font>

114
00:10:48,750 --> 00:10:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then it can't be helped...</font>

115
00:10:53,710 --> 00:10:58,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not gonna be able to!
I'll take you back even by force!</font>

116
00:11:05,890 --> 00:11:07,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you laughing?!</font>

117
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were laughing at that time too.</font>

118
00:11:12,940 --> 00:11:14,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That time...?</font>

119
00:11:14,570 --> 00:11:16,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's funny?</font>

120
00:11:16,110 --> 00:11:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not funny. I am happy.</font>

121
00:11:20,110 --> 00:11:23,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thinking about...
how I can finally defeat you here.</font>

122
00:11:26,290 --> 00:11:30,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That time you wanted to fight me, right?</font>

123
00:11:30,620 --> 00:11:32,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were thrilled weren't you?</font>

124
00:11:32,670 --> 00:11:33,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At first!</font>

125
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:37,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you were different.</font>

126
00:11:39,010 --> 00:11:40,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was...</font>

127
00:11:40,930 --> 00:11:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and come.</font>

128
00:11:42,180 --> 00:11:45,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But first put on your Headband.
I'll wait.</font>

129
00:11:45,640 --> 00:11:47,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't need such a thing...</font>

130
00:11:47,930 --> 00:11:49,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just put it on!</font>

131
00:11:51,810 --> 00:11:56,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You won't be able to
put one scratch on my face.</font>

132
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:58,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not it!</font>

133
00:11:58,780 --> 00:12:03,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saying that this is a sign
that we fight as equal Leaf Shinobi.</font>

134
00:12:03,990 --> 00:12:06,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is what I call a stuck up!</font>

135
00:12:06,580 --> 00:12:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You think you and I are equal?</font>

136
00:12:08,990 --> 00:12:10,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I think so.</font>

137
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never thought I was inferior to you.</font>

138
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're so obnoxious!</font>

139
00:12:17,130 --> 00:12:19,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

140
00:12:31,100 --> 00:12:32,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was...</font>

141
00:12:35,020 --> 00:12:38,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was not the kind of fight I wanted.</font>

142
00:12:40,730 --> 00:12:43,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even now... this isn't...</font>

143
00:12:45,610 --> 00:12:47,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care about
your circumstances.</font>

144
00:13:51,850 --> 00:13:54,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What... is this power?</font>

145
00:13:58,060 --> 00:14:00,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Power is flowing out...</font>

146
00:14:18,370 --> 00:14:20,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the power that
the guy was talking about.</font>

147
00:14:21,250 --> 00:14:24,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Furthermore, the power
is growing into my body.</font>

148
00:14:30,090 --> 00:14:35,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it is like that now...
if I release this curse mark...</font>

149
00:14:38,890 --> 00:14:41,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder how much power...</font>

150
00:14:52,490 --> 00:14:54,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What power...</font>

151
00:14:54,990 --> 00:14:58,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not the same as before...</font>

152
00:15:58,220 --> 00:16:00,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wake up already!</font>

153
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I awakened long ago...</font>

154
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:32,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From my idiotic self who dreams about
a lax peaceful future...</font>

155
00:16:36,300 --> 00:16:38,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">hanging out with comrades.</font>

156
00:16:40,390 --> 00:16:42,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I left the village!</font>

157
00:16:42,980 --> 00:16:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I sought power!</font>

158
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:48,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My dream is not in the future.</font>

159
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:52,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My dream is in the past...</font>

160
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:56,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the only place it exists.</font>

161
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:52,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, onii-san!</font>

162
00:17:52,170 --> 00:17:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You hit the target right in the middle,
even the one behind the rock!</font>

163
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:58,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, me too!</font>

164
00:17:59,050 --> 00:18:01,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke, let's go home.</font>

165
00:18:03,850 --> 00:18:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez... You said that
you would teach me a new shuriken jutsu.</font>

166
00:18:07,730 --> 00:18:12,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is an important mission tomorrow
and I need to prepare for that.</font>

167
00:18:14,690 --> 00:18:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Liar...</font>

168
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:32,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive me Sasuke...
Another time.</font>

169
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san, watch me!</font>

170
00:18:40,930 --> 00:18:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! If you push yourself...</font>

171
00:18:51,270 --> 00:18:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is the one who twisted
his ankle laughing?</font>

172
00:18:54,860 --> 00:18:58,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that you are trying
to take the easy way?</font>

173
00:18:58,490 --> 00:18:59,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not true...</font>

174
00:19:00,860 --> 00:19:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm happy thinking about</font>

175
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:04,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">how I'm finally going to
the Academy starting tomorrow.</font>

176
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to do my best
when I enter the Academy.</font>

177
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:15,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that even father will approve of me.</font>

178
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:19,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He will count on me
like he does on my brother...</font>

179
00:20:34,540 --> 00:20:39,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke... You really are...</font>

180
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you...</font>

181
00:20:46,180 --> 00:20:49,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't need a future
with you guys anymore.</font>

